This distribution contains the following sub-components with additional
licensing notes:

1. Sovereign Data Boundary (src/nexus_eda/sovereign/)
   - AES-256-GCM encrypted storage
   - Audit trail with hash-chain signatures
   - GDPR/ITAR compliance modules
   All licensed under Apache 2.0.

2. Commercial Tier Features
   - SSO/SAML integration
   - ITAR audit trail (enterprise tier)
   - Multi-agent orchestration (Phase 2)
   - 3D viewer (Phase 3)
   These require a Nexus-EDA Enterprise or Defense license.

3. Third-party model weights
   The software does not ship with model weights.  Models are downloaded
   separately by the user from HuggingFace and cached locally.  Each model's
   license applies to that model file only.  The software enforces a
   non-training guarantee: no data processed by the sovereign boundary is
   used to train or fine-tune any model.

